  "changed_since_previous": "",
  "card": "Prevents Bitcoin Core from disconnecting all peers sharing an IP address when a single misbehaving peer is discouraged. Currently, `MaybeDiscourageAndDisconnect` disconnects by IP subnet, allowing an attacker sharing a Tor exit node to disconnect all honest inbound peers connected through that same exit node. The change modifies disconnection handling to mark only the specific offending connection for disconnect.",
